IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STATEMENT-GENERATOR.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BALANCE-AMOUNT PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
01 N              PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 I              PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 TRANS-TYPE     PIC X.
01 TRANS-AMOUNT   PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT BALANCE-AMOUNT.
    ACCEPT N.

    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL I > N

        ACCEPT TRANS-TYPE
        ACCEPT TRANS-AMOUNT

        EVALUATE TRANS-TYPE
            WHEN "C"
                ADD TRANS-AMOUNT TO BALANCE-AMOUNT
                DISPLAY BALANCE-AMOUNT

            WHEN "D"
                IF TRANS-AMOUNT <= BALANCE-AMOUNT
                    SUBTRACT TRANS-AMOUNT FROM BALANCE-AMOUNT
                    DISPLAY BALANCE-AMOUNT
                ELSE
                    DISPLAY "REJECTED: " BALANCE-AMOUNT
                END-IF

            WHEN OTHER
                DISPLAY "REJECTED: " BALANCE-AMOUNT
        END-EVALUATE

    END-PERFORM.

    STOP RUN.
